<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70731" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νηρηΐς</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νηρεΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ΐδος, ἡ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>daughter of Nereus,
			sea-nymph</i> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ναϊάς,</span>
			<i>spring-nymph</i>): mostly in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νηρηΐδες,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				11.2
			</span></i>; title of play by Anaxandrides, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.482c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νηρεΐδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					8.11
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>)<i><span class="en">
				5.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				2.436
			</span></i>, title of play by Aeschylus; 
				Att.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νηρῇδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					174
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				719
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1267
			</span></i>, etc.; they were fifty in number, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				264
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				6(5).6
			</span></i>; their names are given, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.39s
			</span></i>qq., <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				243
			</span></i> sqq.: rare in sg., gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νηρηΐδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					546
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
